## Third-party components

None. The verifier (`verify.mjs`) has zero dependencies by design — it uses
only Node.js built-ins (`node:crypto`, `node:fs`) — and the test suite uses
Node's built-in test runner. The anchors in `anchors.jsonl` are audit data
produced by the Conduit Router gateway, mirrored here unchanged.
